---
---

<section class="expansion-fullwidth-section" id="expansion-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="expansion-minimal-content">
      
      <div class="expansion-tag-row">
        <span class="expansion-pulse-dot"></span>
        <span class="expansion-tag red-text" data-i18n="banner_tag">EKSPANSI STRATEGIS & PENGEMBANGAN USAHA</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="expansion-heading" data-i18n="banner_title">
        PT CHAIN ASIA CONECT <br />
        <span class="red-text">Perusahaan Utama dalam Fase Ekspansi Usaha & Kemitraan</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="expansion-desc" data-i18n="banner_desc">
        Sebagai entitas bisnis yang berfokus pada diversifikasi berkelanjutan dan penskalaan usaha, kami terbuka untuk kolaborasi kemitraan B2B strategis dalam infrastruktur rantai pasok terintegrasi, rekayasa mesin medis presisi & lisensi perangkat lunak 3D PACS, serta operasional jaringan cabang regional di seluruh Indonesia dan Asia.
      </p>

      <div class="expansion-actions">
        <a href="mailto:sales@chainasiaconnect.co.id" class="btn-minimal-primary">
          <span data-i18n="btn_partnership">Inisiasi Kemitraan Strategis (sales@chainasiaconnect.co.id) →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:info@chainasiaconnect.co.id" class="btn-minimal-secondary">
          <span data-i18n="btn_contact">info@chainasiaconnect.co.id</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .expansion-fullwidth-section {
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .expansion-minimal-content {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .expansion-tag-row {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .expansion-pulse-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--red-primary, #dc2626);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2);
  }

  .expansion-tag {
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .expansion-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .expansion-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #475569;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .expansion-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-minimal-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    background: var(--red-primary, #dc2626);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-minimal-primary:hover {
    background: #b91c1c;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-minimal-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-minimal-secondary:hover {
    color: var(--red-primary, #dc2626);
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
    background: #fafafa;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .expansion-fullwidth-section {
      padding: 3.5rem 0;
    }

    .expansion-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .btn-minimal-primary,
    .btn-minimal-secondary {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
